{"nodes": [{"id": "build_css_p2_docs_css_pages_phase_0_how_css_runs_devtools_for_css_error_console", "label": "DevTools as the CSS error console", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "build-css-p2/docs/css/pages/phase-0-how-css-runs/devtools-for-css.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Because CSS reports nothing, the Styles pane is the error console the language lacks. Inspect first: which rules match, which declarations lost."}, {"id": "build_css_p2_docs_css_pages_phase_0_how_css_runs_devtools_for_css_struck_through_two_causes", "label": "Struck-through declaration: two causes", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "build-css-p2/docs/css/pages/phase-0-how-css-runs/devtools-for-css.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Cascade loss (winner in Computed) versus parse failure (warning triangle, property missing from Computed). Opposite fixes: specificity/layer vs syntax."}, {"id": "build_css_p2_docs_css_pages_phase_0_how_css_runs_devtools_for_css_debugging_order", "label": "CSS debugging order", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "build-css-p2/docs/css/pages/phase-0-how-css-runs/devtools-for-css.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "In order: is the element in the DOM, did the rule parse, did it match ($0.matches), did it win (strike-through/Computed), is the box where you think (Layout)."}], "edges": [{"source": "build_css_p2_docs_css_pages_phase_0_how_css_runs_devtools_for_css_error_console", "target": "build_css_p2_docs_css_pages_phase_0_how_css_runs_devtools_for_css_struck_through_two_causes", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "build-css-p2/docs/css/pages/phase-0-how-css-runs/devtools-for-css.html", "source_location": null, "weigh